If you enjoyed this video, leave me a thumbs up,

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:24.020
And if you want to hear more of me overanalyzing anime and manga, make sure to hit that subscribe button, with the little bell.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:28.680
I hope to see you around next time, and until then have a wonderful week.

